  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan soul searches Jun Shen Guang and learns that Central Continent’s Four Xunzi are time path Gu Immortals, quadruplets found young by Spirit Butterfly Valley and specially nurtured: three older brothers and one younger sister, Shang Xunzi, Zhong Xunzi, Xia Xunzi, and Xun Guo Zi. The novel spelling is Xia Xunzi.",
      "chapters": [
        1628
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_shang_xunzi",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "char_zhong_xunzi",
        "char_xun_guo_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jun Shen Guang’s information places all Four Xunzi at rank seven with a combination technique that can briefly contest a rank eight. They jointly control Present and Past Pavilion after Spirit Butterfly Valley complies with Heavenly Court’s River of Time arrangements.",
      "chapters": [
        1629
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-pavilion-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_present_and_past_pavilion",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fight, Xia Xunzi strokes his beard and says that even though Present and Past Pavilion is not Fang Yuan’s match, stalling until Eternal Yacht arrives will let their side win. Fang Yuan still wrecks the pavilion and kicks the Four Xunzi into the river.",
      "chapters": [
        1629
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-pavilion-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eternal_yacht"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Eternal Yacht, Xia Xunzi has already fainted with severe injuries. Shang Xunzi glances at him, focuses on Present and Past Pavilion instead, then uses the siblings’ unique revival killer move. All Four Xunzi soon return to the deck with no injuries.",
      "chapters": [
        1630
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "injuries-and-revival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Xun Guo Zi dies blocking time cutting edge for Qing Ye, Xia Xunzi is among the three brothers who stay calm at first because they expect to revive her. Qing Ye says the method will fail this time, and they become fearful.",
      "chapters": [
        1633
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sisters-sacrifice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qing_ye"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, Xia Xunzi is again among the Four Xunzi in Present and Past Pavilion. He looks at Zhong Xunzi when Shang Xunzi reports a possible ripple on the folding screen.",
      "chapters": [
        1753
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-of-time-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Present and Past Pavilion’s sawtooth whirlpool fails to break Myriad Year Flying Warship’s defense, Xia Xunzi pats Xun Guo Zi’s shoulder and tells her to relax, saying the ship will crumble if bitten longer. Inwardly the Four Xunzi remain astonished at the ship’s durability.",
      "chapters": [
        1805
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sawtooth-whirlpool-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship shatters Present and Past Pavilion. The Four Xunzi fall into the River of Time and are all killed by Fang Yuan shortly afterward.",
      "chapters": [
        1806
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-the-river-of-time",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
